WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.700
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.401
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.203
We hope you're doing well

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:04.069
and now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.069 --> 00:00:05.371
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:08.340
After announcing
his 2024 reelection campaign,

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:10.443
President Biden delivered
a speech yesterday

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:12.411
about his economic vision
for the country.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:14.180
That's right, from now on,

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:17.049
the grandkids are getting $6

00:00:17.049 --> 00:00:18.151
in their birthday cards.

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:19.619
[ Laughter, cheering,
and applause ]

00:00:19.619 --> 00:00:21.354
Vermont Senator Bernie Sanders

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:22.889
endorsed President Biden
yesterday

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.925
and said he will do what he can
to make sure Biden is reelected.

00:00:25.925 --> 00:00:27.827
But if Biden loses,
the two of them

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:29.895
can always go back
to heckling the Muppets.

00:00:29.895 --> 00:00:32.331
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:33.700
Following recent reports

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.336
of Justice Clarence Thomas'
failure to disclose

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:40.072
lavish vacations and gifts
from a wealthy Republican donor,

00:00:40.072 --> 00:00:41.374
the Supreme Court released

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.109
a three-page
statement yesterday,

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.312
signed by all nine justices,
committing to follow,

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.748
"foundational ethics
and principles."

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:50.382
Starting now.
I mean, now.

00:00:50.382 --> 00:00:52.418
[ Laughter and applause ]
Okay, now! Damn it, Clarence!

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.053
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.053 --> 00:00:56.488
That's right,
all nine Supreme Court justices

00:00:56.488 --> 00:00:57.757
signed a pledge to follow

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.859
"foundational ethics
and principles."

00:00:59.859 --> 00:01:03.195
Okay, but it wasn't all nine
of them we were worried about.

00:01:03.195 --> 00:01:05.831
[ Laughter ]
I mean, Elena Kagan's
last vacation was

00:01:05.831 --> 00:01:07.266
to the Lincoln Memorial.

00:01:07.266 --> 00:01:09.335
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:10.703
Took the bus.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:11.871
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:13.706
In honor
of Lesbian Visibility Week,

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.476
the cast of
"The L Word: Generation Q"

00:01:16.476 --> 00:01:18.377
yesterday
visited the White House,

00:01:18.377 --> 00:01:20.480
said Tucker Carlson
to a house plant.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:23.215
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.215 --> 00:01:25.051
A top aide to Republican

00:01:25.051 --> 00:01:27.586
presidential hopeful
Vivek Ramaswamy

00:01:27.586 --> 00:01:29.188
said today
that he will be polling

00:01:29.188 --> 00:01:32.358
in second or third place
by the end of the year.

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:35.294
Unless, of course,
a fourth person joins the race.

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:37.397
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:37.397 --> 00:01:39.632
The USDA announced yesterday

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.434
that it is considering
making changes

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.968
to limit the amount
of salmonella

00:01:42.968 --> 00:01:44.604
in some chicken products.

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:46.706
I'm sorry,
they haven't already?

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.007
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.276
"We're also considering
a three strikes rule,

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:51.845
if it's secretly a pigeon.

00:01:51.845 --> 00:01:55.981
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:01:55.981 --> 00:01:57.850
[ Cheering ]
You can get away with it twice."

00:01:57.850 --> 00:01:59.352
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:01.253
Ben and Jerry's cofounder
Ben Cohen

00:02:01.253 --> 00:02:06.326
recently launched a new cannabis
line called Ben's Best Blnz.

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.660
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:10.563
Hopefully it's a lot
more popular than...

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.533
[ Laughter, ohhs, and applause ]

00:02:17.603 --> 00:02:18.671
That was easy to do

00:02:18.671 --> 00:02:20.473
because we had a pack
lying around.

00:02:20.473 --> 00:02:21.940
[ Laughter ]

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.010
Quarterback Aaron Rodgers
reportedly spent a week

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:26.578
in Costa Rica
at a spiritual healing center

00:02:26.578 --> 00:02:28.814
before officially signing
with the New York Jets,

00:02:28.814 --> 00:02:32.051
which is like washing your car
right before it rains.

00:02:32.051 --> 00:02:34.320
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.389
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos was
photographed over the weekend

00:02:37.389 --> 00:02:39.959
at Coachella
and even he couldn't believe

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.694
how much they were charging
for water.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.396
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.731
And, finally, authorities
in Mexico recently seized

00:02:45.731 --> 00:02:48.567
nearly 12,000 tequila bottles
that contained

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.169
concentrated liquid meth.

00:02:50.169 --> 00:02:52.504
On the bright side,
Margarita night ended

00:02:52.504 --> 00:02:55.274
with a completely
spotless house.

00:02:55.274 --> 00:02:56.375
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:57.944
And that was a monologue,
everybody.

